,43,113,24],[29824,20.0,1976,45,115,24],[29825,20.2,1976,53,114,25],[29826,20.4,1976,58,114,25]],"links":[["Hand County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/south-dakota/hand-county"],["ARC or PLC in Hand County","/arc-plc/south-dakota/hand-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, Hand County has a record of 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 16 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years. On the middle of the grids, that same pair was 17% of normal in 2025 and is 16% so far in 2026. Every grid had its driest year in 1976, and grid 28923 was down to 41% of normal that year.</p>"}
